//! if a && b
//! A \ b
//! isfile('foo')
//! ```
//!
//! ### Fixed
//!
//! ```diff
//! - if a & b
//! + if a && b
//! ```
//!
//! ## Configuration
//!
//! ```toml
//! [lint.rules.PERFORMANCE_ENGINE]
//! severity = "info"
//! skip_checks = ["AGROW", "ST2NM"]
//! ```

